{"id":"palais","lemma":"palais","pos":"noun","rank":1759,"glosses":["palace","courthouse (palais de justice)"],"ipa":"/pa.lɛ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/22/Fr-palais.ogg/Fr-palais.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","examples":[{"text":"Elle me conduisit au palais.","en":"She guided me to the palace.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to drive","l":"conduire"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Le palais était fortement gardé.","en":"The palace was heavily guarded.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"strongly"},{"g":"to keep","l":"garder"}]},{"text":"Le roi et sa famille vivent au palais royal.","en":"The king and his family live in the royal palace.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"king"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"his"},{"g":"family"},{"g":"to live","l":"vivre"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"royal"}]},{"text":"Comparée à notre maison, la vôtre est un palais.","en":"Compared to our house, yours is a palace.","words":[{"g":"compared","l":"comparé"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"our"},{"g":"house, home"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Je me suis brûlé le palais en mangeant de la pizza.","en":"I burned the roof of my mouth eating pizza.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"burnt, burned"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"to eat","l":"manger"},null,null,{"g":"pizza"}],"phrases":[[8,10,"of the"]]}]}